WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.290
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.560 --> 03:11.040
I'm not going to deny my own feelings anymore.

3
03:11.120 --> 03:11.880
PREVIOUSLY

4
03:11.960 --> 03:12.920
I'll protect you.

5
03:13.000 --> 03:14.520
Pong…

6
03:15.120 --> 03:17.400
He threatened to kill me.

7
03:17.480 --> 03:18.920
So I poisoned him.

8
03:19.000 --> 03:21.200
I was Raiwin's first wife.

9
03:21.280 --> 03:24.200
It isn't true. Say something.

10
03:24.720 --> 03:27.040
Why didn't you ever tell me?

11
03:30.800 --> 03:31.840
Chayanee.

12
03:35.080 --> 03:36.080
I'm sorry.

13
03:37.440 --> 03:39.120
I didn't want to tell you

14
03:39.200 --> 03:42.520
because it was a terrible part of my past. The worst part of my life.

15
03:46.520 --> 03:48.600
And you think it's been good for my life?

16
03:57.040 --> 03:58.880
I told you, didn't I?

17
04:01.760 --> 04:03.760
Never make me suffer.

18
04:05.400 --> 04:07.200
Never make me cry.

19
04:14.160 --> 04:16.160
I gave you everything.

20
04:17.440 --> 04:19.920
Do you have any idea how much money I spent helping you?

21
04:24.000 --> 04:25.040
I'm sorry.

22
04:29.200 --> 04:30.320
Please…

23
04:31.080 --> 04:32.640
put the gun down.

24
04:38.320 --> 04:39.600
I got pregnant

25
04:41.320 --> 04:43.720
because I wanted us to have a family.

26
04:45.800 --> 04:48.040
And you ruined everything.

27
04:49.280 --> 04:52.360
Now Nuchwara has made a fool out of me.

28
04:58.920 --> 04:59.960
Chayanee.

29
05:01.200 --> 05:02.720
Don't think like that.

30
05:05.240 --> 05:06.440
I love you,

31
05:07.400 --> 05:08.920
and I love our baby.

32
05:10.320 --> 05:13.920
We can start over. We'll register our marriage

33
05:14.000 --> 05:15.720
and become legally married.

34
05:27.000 --> 05:28.840
You love me?

35
05:30.360 --> 05:31.600
You're the only woman I love.

36
05:37.440 --> 05:38.920
Would you die for me?

37
05:44.600 --> 05:46.120
You don't have to die for me.

38
05:47.880 --> 05:49.400
But if you really love me,

39
05:51.600 --> 05:53.120
you have to do something for me.

40
05:59.600 --> 06:02.640
Nuchwara humiliated me and made me suffer.

41
06:03.520 --> 06:06.680
It feels like she slapped me in front of everyone.

42
06:08.560 --> 06:10.000
I don't want to see her again.

43
06:12.000 --> 06:13.000
Fine.

44
06:13.880 --> 06:15.480
I'll throw Nuchwara out.

45
06:16.000 --> 06:17.720
She'll never set foot here again.

46
06:30.920 --> 06:32.040
Kill her.

47
06:36.680 --> 06:37.960
If you can't do it,

48
06:39.240 --> 06:40.880
don't ever show your face here again.

49
06:44.360 --> 06:47.120
And I'll expose your vote buying and election fraud.

50
06:49.120 --> 06:50.240
Go ahead.

51
06:51.920 --> 06:53.200
You choose.

52
06:54.600 --> 06:56.600
Are you going to save her life…

53
06:58.160 --> 06:59.840
or save your own?

54
07:12.400 --> 07:13.760
What are they talking about?

55
07:14.960 --> 07:18.920
Saksit is being investigated over the garbage-truck procurement project.

56
07:19.000 --> 07:20.440
And several other projects show

57
07:21.200 --> 07:22.560
signs of corruption too.

58
07:22.640 --> 07:24.600
The old streetlight case

59
07:24.680 --> 07:27.200
still hasn't been cleared up. Now there are more cases?

60
07:28.000 --> 07:30.240
Everyone must face the consequences of their actions.

61
07:33.240 --> 07:34.880
Boss.

62
07:35.600 --> 07:37.440
Someone's here to see you.

63
07:46.200 --> 07:47.280
Open it! Open it up!

64
07:47.360 --> 07:48.680
Well? Do you like it?

65
07:48.760 --> 07:51.760
Now that you've got your food. Please enjoy.

66
07:51.840 --> 07:54.320
I brought you a video of Raiwin and his father buying votes.

67
07:54.920 --> 07:56.960
Why did you change your mind and turn on him?

68
07:58.560 --> 07:59.960
I remember

69
08:00.040 --> 08:02.600
you saying you hated corrupt politicians.

70
08:02.680 --> 08:04.480
But you still took their money.

71
08:04.560 --> 08:06.080
You were right.

72
08:07.280 --> 08:08.800
We kept voting for whoever paid us.

73
08:08.880 --> 08:11.440
Then once they got into office. They never did

74
08:11.520 --> 08:12.600
anything for the people.

75
08:14.040 --> 08:15.960
I've had enough of crooked politicians

76
08:16.040 --> 08:17.520
living off our tax money.

77
08:17.600 --> 08:19.320
What do you want me to do?

78
08:19.400 --> 08:21.360
Help file a complaint about the election fraud.

79
08:22.000 --> 08:23.440
The villagers and I will testify.

80
08:23.520 --> 08:24.640
But…

81
08:24.720 --> 08:26.920
you could be prosecuted too

82
08:27.000 --> 08:27.960
for selling your votes.

83
08:28.040 --> 08:29.720
So be it.

84
08:29.800 --> 08:32.080
I don't want them passing their corrupt power down.

85
08:32.159 --> 08:34.400
I'll send you every video I have of them buying votes.

86
08:40.360 --> 08:41.600
Dad.

87
08:42.240 --> 08:45.560
Have you heard? Someone filed a complaint against me for buying votes.

88
08:45.640 --> 08:47.640
You too?

89
08:48.280 --> 08:50.840
I'm already being investigated over my old projects.

90
08:51.440 --> 08:53.760
Who has the nerve to come after us like this?

91
08:53.840 --> 08:56.640
I've already spent a fortune paying off reporters

92
08:56.720 --> 08:59.080
and silencing complainants.

93
08:59.840 --> 09:01.240
So what do we do now?

94
09:01.320 --> 09:03.640
You find more money.

95
09:03.720 --> 09:06.320
Otherwise, everything we've done will collapse.

96
09:06.400 --> 09:08.360
Go ask your wife for money.

97
09:08.440 --> 09:10.720
Then use whatever she gives you

98
09:10.800 --> 09:14.120
to silence the reporters and the committee investigating us.

99
09:14.200 --> 09:16.520
Nuchwara already exposed everything, Dad.

100
09:17.520 --> 09:20.080
Chayanee knows Papang is my son now.

101
09:20.160 --> 09:21.440
She's furious.

102
09:22.080 --> 09:23.320
She won't help me anymore.

103
09:23.400 --> 09:24.600
Damn it!

104
09:25.240 --> 09:27.000
You find that money somehow.

105
09:27.080 --> 09:29.680
If you can't, you and I

106
09:29.760 --> 09:31.280
are both

107
09:31.360 --> 09:32.480
going to prison.

108
09:32.560 --> 09:35.200
Get up. Go!

109
09:35.280 --> 09:37.640
And don't come back until you find the money.

110
09:37.720 --> 09:39.880
Remember, I am not going to prison.

111
09:40.400 --> 09:41.560
Damn it!

112
09:43.320 --> 09:45.360
Is there anything I can do to help?

113
09:45.440 --> 09:47.680
You? What could you possibly do for me?

114
09:47.760 --> 09:50.960
Don't forget. Ramil inherited a lot of money.

115
09:51.480 --> 09:53.440
He has enough to help you.

116
09:53.520 --> 09:56.120
You think your son Ramil would help me?

117
09:58.000 --> 09:59.600
If I ask him,

118
10:00.400 --> 10:01.880
he won't refuse me.

119
10:02.480 --> 10:04.600
What do you want?

120
10:05.640 --> 10:06.960
Why are you suddenly being nice

121
10:07.680 --> 10:08.640
and offering to help?

122
10:13.160 --> 10:14.600
You know

123
10:14.680 --> 10:17.960
how grateful I am for everything you've done for me.

124
10:18.720 --> 10:19.680
You used to call

125
10:20.680 --> 10:23.640
my son and me parasites.

126
10:24.720 --> 10:27.560
Let me finally repay you.

127
10:35.280 --> 10:37.280
I need 20 million.

128
10:38.800 --> 10:40.160
Can you get it for me?

129
10:45.920 --> 10:50.200
MAE THONG TEM - THAI TRADITIONAL DESERT

130
10:53.400 --> 10:55.240
This looks great.

131
10:55.320 --> 10:56.720
These are all my favorites.

132
10:56.800 --> 11:00.040
Who would know what you like better than someone who loves you?

133
11:19.840 --> 11:20.960
Well…

134
11:22.240 --> 11:24.800
your mother really wanted to see you.

135
11:25.360 --> 11:27.760
It must be something important.

136
11:28.280 --> 11:29.480
I…

137
11:30.880 --> 11:34.440
I'm only asking you to have one meal with her. Just this once.

138
11:35.000 --> 11:38.720
After this, I won't put you in an uncomfortable position again.

139
11:42.000 --> 11:43.000
Please.

140
11:45.400 --> 11:46.720
Aunt Sanguansri, please sit.

141
11:59.360 --> 12:01.240
The food here is good.

142
12:01.320 --> 12:04.000
But I think you'd like my cooking better.

143
12:05.640 --> 12:07.040
Just tell me what you want.

144
12:07.760 --> 12:08.800
So I can get back to work.

145
12:14.160 --> 12:15.400
I want to

146
12:16.200 --> 12:17.240
ask you for some money.

147
12:18.320 --> 12:19.480
What for?

148
12:21.200 --> 12:22.520
Don't tell me

149
12:25.000 --> 12:26.920
you're going to pull strings to help them.

150
12:28.440 --> 12:29.360
Yes.

151
12:30.120 --> 12:34.080
Mom. Have you lived with them so long that you've become just like them?

152
12:34.160 --> 12:36.680
You know I hate corrupt people.

153
12:37.400 --> 12:39.240
And I'll make sure they pay for this.

154
12:45.080 --> 12:46.400
I have to do this.

155
12:47.320 --> 12:48.560
Please.

156
12:49.200 --> 12:52.200
Think of this money as buying my freedom.

157
12:53.400 --> 12:55.880
And after this, I'll never bother you again. Please.

158
13:14.440 --> 13:16.600
I know you meant well.

159
13:17.400 --> 13:19.200
You wanted my mom and me to work things out.

160
13:19.840 --> 13:21.280
But it was a waste of time.

161
13:21.920 --> 13:24.200
Mom will do anything for that…

162
13:26.720 --> 13:28.120
terrible man.

163
13:29.840 --> 13:33.640
Are you going to help her?

164
13:37.560 --> 13:38.720
I…

165
13:39.960 --> 13:43.680
I'm not going to interfere with your decision.

166
13:45.320 --> 13:47.520
But I know your mother has a reason.

167
13:48.880 --> 13:51.800
And I think it's a good one.

168
13:56.560 --> 13:57.880
She's my mom…

169
13:59.920 --> 14:01.600
and even I barely trust her.

170
14:05.120 --> 14:07.360
Why are you defending her so strongly?

171
14:08.560 --> 14:09.920
Why are you so sure?

172
14:10.920 --> 14:12.000
Huh?

173
14:12.960 --> 14:15.920
Well… I'm a woman too.

174
14:16.920 --> 14:18.200
I can tell.

175
14:19.320 --> 14:20.560
Your mother

176
14:21.360 --> 14:22.880
loves you very much.

177
14:27.360 --> 14:30.320
Nuch, what do you want?

178
14:30.400 --> 14:32.600
What are you talking about?

179
14:32.680 --> 14:34.560
You filed a complaint

180
14:34.640 --> 14:36.560
about me buying votes.

181
14:37.240 --> 14:40.320
Did you actually buy votes?

182
14:40.920 --> 14:43.600
If you won that position honestly,

183
14:44.320 --> 14:46.720
then you have nothing to be afraid of.

184
14:47.440 --> 14:48.840
Don't play games with me.

185
14:48.920 --> 14:51.840
I know you're trying to get revenge

186
14:51.920 --> 14:53.960
by having me removed as Subdistrict Chief.

187
14:54.040 --> 14:55.080
Yes.

188
14:56.840 --> 15:00.280
I'm going to make you pay for what you did to me and my son.

189
15:00.360 --> 15:03.040
You're nothing but a political parasite.

190
15:03.920 --> 15:06.720
I want my son to grow up in a decent society.

191
15:08.000 --> 15:10.280
Not one filled with corrupt people like you.

192
15:11.320 --> 15:12.960
Don't challenge me.

193
15:13.720 --> 15:17.040
Does it hurt? You must be furious. You must hate me.

194
15:17.120 --> 15:19.320
Now you know what it feels like

195
15:20.000 --> 15:23.520
to be betrayed.

196
15:24.120 --> 15:26.120
I only filed the complaint.

197
15:26.720 --> 15:28.720
I haven't submitted the evidence yet.

198
15:30.280 --> 15:32.920
If you don't want things to get worse,

199
15:33.960 --> 15:35.120
resign before they force you.

200
15:36.680 --> 15:39.160
I won't let anyone destroy my life.

201
15:39.960 --> 15:41.280
If you don't want to die,

202
15:42.080 --> 15:43.360
withdraw the complaint.

203
15:43.440 --> 15:47.000
Go ahead. I have nothing left to lose.

204
15:47.680 --> 15:49.520
Do whatever you want.

205
15:50.520 --> 15:52.400
You're nothing but a coward

206
15:52.920 --> 15:56.800
who hides in his father's shadow.

207
15:57.560 --> 15:59.040
You live off women

208
15:59.800 --> 16:01.680
and hide behind their skirts.

209
16:01.760 --> 16:03.040
Shut up!

210
16:03.720 --> 16:06.120
I have to be Chief. I have to become a minister.

211
16:06.200 --> 16:07.360
Mommy! Let Mommy go!

212
16:12.320 --> 16:13.440
Nuch.

213
16:15.400 --> 16:16.840
Are you okay?

214
16:27.000 --> 16:28.120
Please…

215
16:29.160 --> 16:30.520
help me.

216
16:35.640 --> 16:36.760
Please help me.

217
16:41.160 --> 16:42.680
I have no one else.

218
16:44.360 --> 16:46.320
You're the only person who can help me.

219
16:48.280 --> 16:49.680
I need money.

220
16:49.760 --> 16:53.880
I need money to make these cases go away.

221
16:55.640 --> 16:57.160
Your father created these problems.

222
16:58.880 --> 17:00.720
So did you.

223
17:01.840 --> 17:03.640
Why should I get dragged into them?

224
17:04.960 --> 17:08.119
No one else can help me.

225
17:08.960 --> 17:11.920
I need to keep my position as Subdistrict Chief.

226
17:12.839 --> 17:14.440
Next term,

227
17:14.520 --> 17:16.000
I'll run for Parliament.

228
17:17.800 --> 17:20.720
And I'll make you a minister's wife.

229
17:20.800 --> 17:22.119
I promise.

230
17:27.240 --> 17:29.600
I'm done dreaming that big.

231
17:30.920 --> 17:32.880
There's only one little thing

232
17:34.200 --> 17:35.840
I want from you first.

233
17:38.880 --> 17:40.240
Kill Nuchwara.

234
17:45.000 --> 17:46.120
Hey…

235
17:48.400 --> 17:50.120
Please ask me to do something else.

236
17:51.760 --> 17:53.240
I can't kill someone.

237
17:58.000 --> 18:01.840
Or are you going to wait until she destroys you first?

238
18:06.080 --> 18:07.560
If you let her live,

239
18:09.720 --> 18:12.120
one day she'll destroy your life.

240
18:16.760 --> 18:20.080
Even if you become prime minister,

241
18:21.640 --> 18:25.000
she'll keep coming after you.

242
18:35.760 --> 18:38.360
I'll stay by your side.

243
18:41.480 --> 18:44.400
I'll help you with everything.

244
19:01.600 --> 19:02.800
You're back.

245
19:04.160 --> 19:05.120
Come here.

246
19:07.040 --> 19:08.800
Well?

247
19:09.320 --> 19:10.760
The money.

248
19:11.960 --> 19:12.840
Did he transfer it?

249
19:14.480 --> 19:15.880
He hasn't given me an answer yet.

250
19:17.000 --> 19:18.160
What do you mean?

251
19:18.240 --> 19:21.200
You told me if you spoke to him, he'd help you.

252
19:21.800 --> 19:22.760
I warned you

253
19:22.840 --> 19:24.760
he had no intention of helping me.

254
19:25.720 --> 19:27.520
Get out.

255
19:27.600 --> 19:30.840
Go live with that arrogant son of yours. Go!

256
19:35.760 --> 19:36.760
It's Ramil.

257
19:36.840 --> 19:39.680
Then answer it. Talk to him.

258
19:41.920 --> 19:42.800
Hello.

259
19:42.880 --> 19:44.000
I'll give you the money.

260
19:44.960 --> 19:46.960
But this is the last time I'm helping.

261
19:48.040 --> 19:50.560
Thank you, Ramil.

262
19:51.680 --> 19:52.640
Yes.

263
19:54.440 --> 19:55.480
Hey.

264
19:56.080 --> 19:57.360
What did he say?

265
19:58.640 --> 20:00.480
Ramil agreed.

266
20:00.560 --> 20:03.240
I'll give you the money so you can fight the cases.

267
20:03.320 --> 20:04.880
Wow.

268
20:05.680 --> 20:08.440
Thank you so much.

269
20:09.160 --> 20:10.760
You're sacrificing yourself for me.

270
20:11.920 --> 20:12.840
And…

271
20:12.920 --> 20:15.200
I'm sorry

272
20:15.280 --> 20:18.400
if I've spoken badly to you. I've just been stressed.

273
20:18.480 --> 20:21.200
Sanguansri.

274
20:21.280 --> 20:23.240
I'll take you out tonight.

275
20:23.320 --> 20:26.440
We can get something to eat. What would you like?

276
20:27.120 --> 20:30.240
We don't need to go out. Let's eat here.

277
20:30.320 --> 20:34.360
I feel like having a drink too. And I want to talk to you privately.

278
20:34.960 --> 20:36.560
Of course, sweetheart.

279
20:37.640 --> 20:39.440
I'll have them prepare

280
20:39.520 --> 20:41.160
your favorite food and drinks.

281
20:50.200 --> 20:51.080
It's done.

282
20:51.160 --> 20:54.520
I'm glad you agreed to help your mother.

283
20:55.120 --> 20:56.960
I'm choosing to trust you.

284
20:57.040 --> 21:00.400
I believe you must have a good reason for wanting me to help her.

285
21:01.040 --> 21:03.280
I want everything to go back to the way it was.

286
21:03.360 --> 21:04.840
I want you to be happy again.

287
21:22.040 --> 21:23.520
Have another drink.

288
21:23.600 --> 21:25.480
You keep filling my glass.

289
21:25.560 --> 21:27.640
I want to celebrate for you.

290
21:27.720 --> 21:29.280
The money from Ramil

291
21:29.960 --> 21:31.640
will help make the cases go away.

292
21:31.720 --> 21:34.680
And Raiwin's projects can continue too.

293
21:37.160 --> 21:38.080
You really do

294
21:39.040 --> 21:40.760
know me well.

295
21:41.920 --> 21:44.200
That's why I never brought another woman

296
21:45.200 --> 21:46.760
into this house to replace you.

297
21:49.440 --> 21:53.000
Thank you for respecting me as your wife.

298
21:54.320 --> 21:55.960
But there is something

299
21:56.040 --> 21:58.520
troubling me that I want to ask.

300
21:58.600 --> 22:00.160
Ask me anything.

301
22:00.240 --> 22:02.200
There are no secrets between us.

302
22:02.840 --> 22:05.640
When Anon died,

303
22:05.720 --> 22:07.600
a lot of people thought

304
22:07.680 --> 22:09.760
you might have been involved.

305
22:13.280 --> 22:15.040
I'm just wondering.

306
22:16.160 --> 22:18.160
The day you arranged to meet Anon,

307
22:19.080 --> 22:20.240
did you actually see him?

308
22:30.320 --> 22:31.560
Well?

309
22:32.760 --> 22:33.640
Oh.

310
22:36.960 --> 22:38.920
It's exactly what I told you before.

311
22:39.560 --> 22:42.520
I waited at the lawyer's house. Anon never came.

312
22:43.320 --> 22:44.720
Then I heard

313
22:45.720 --> 22:47.160
that he'd been shot and killed.

314
22:48.440 --> 22:50.280
Thinking about it now,

315
22:50.360 --> 22:52.400
I really do feel terrible.

316
22:52.480 --> 22:55.680
We probably should have arranged to meet him here instead.

317
22:56.840 --> 22:58.720
By the way,

318
23:00.880 --> 23:03.240
where are you meeting your son?

319
23:03.320 --> 23:04.960
I'll drive you.

320
23:05.040 --> 23:07.160
Just send me the location.

321
23:09.560 --> 23:10.400
All right.

322
23:25.840 --> 23:26.920
Where are you going?

323
23:29.640 --> 23:31.560
You don't need to worry about me.

324
23:32.600 --> 23:34.920
Spend your time fixing your own problems.

325
23:36.880 --> 23:37.960
I'll drive you.

326
23:39.000 --> 23:40.760
What made you want to drive me?

327
23:42.640 --> 23:45.280
I want to make sure you're really leaving my life.

328
23:50.160 --> 23:51.600
Don't worry.

329
23:52.320 --> 23:54.120
I don't want to see your face either.

330
23:55.280 --> 23:56.560
Although before long,

331
23:57.240 --> 23:59.160
I might come visit you in prison.

332
24:04.560 --> 24:06.280
Do you want me to come with you?

333
24:07.080 --> 24:08.640
It's okay.

334
24:08.720 --> 24:11.720
I'm just taking the money to Mom. I'll be right back.

335
24:12.320 --> 24:13.160
Okay.

336
24:14.120 --> 24:15.400
Daddy.

337
24:15.480 --> 24:16.600
Oh?

338
24:16.680 --> 24:18.440
Where's Mommy?

339
24:21.160 --> 24:23.680
Mommy went home.

340
24:23.760 --> 24:25.120
She just has some work to do.

341
24:25.200 --> 24:27.240
Stay with Daddy for now, okay?

342
24:27.320 --> 24:29.560
I had a nightmare.

343
24:29.640 --> 24:33.400
I dreamed a giant monster took Mommy away.

344
24:34.000 --> 24:36.880
I miss her.

345
24:36.960 --> 24:37.920
Oh…

346
24:38.000 --> 24:41.480
Daddy, please take me to see Mommy.

347
24:42.320 --> 24:44.680
-Please. -Calm down, Papang.

348
24:47.160 --> 24:50.400
Don't cry, sweetheart. It's okay.

349
24:53.880 --> 24:57.640
Let Daddy take care of his errand first. I'll take you to Mommy myself.

350
24:57.720 --> 25:01.040
-Come on. No more crying. -I'll send you the location.

351
25:01.120 --> 25:02.520
-Okay. -Take care of him.

352
25:02.600 --> 25:03.760
I will.

353
25:03.840 --> 25:05.080
Go with Aunt Hathaya.

354
25:05.720 --> 25:07.360
I'll be back.

355
25:09.560 --> 25:11.640
Everything's okay. I'll take you to Mommy.

356
25:22.760 --> 25:23.680
Hello, Dad.

357
25:23.760 --> 25:24.840
Raiwin.

358
25:25.680 --> 25:27.680
Ramil is bringing money to his mother.

359
25:28.280 --> 25:29.240
Come with me.

360
25:29.800 --> 25:32.360
We'll deal with him the same way we dealt with Anon.

361
25:33.600 --> 25:34.840
Kill him.

362
25:38.240 --> 25:39.920
You're getting his money anyway.

363
25:40.000 --> 25:41.360
Why do you need to kill him?

364
25:41.440 --> 25:44.640
Twenty million is nothing. Understand?

365
25:45.280 --> 25:46.320
If Ramil dies,

366
25:47.560 --> 25:50.120
all his property and inheritance go to his mother.

367
25:50.200 --> 25:52.360
And then they become mine.

368
25:54.160 --> 25:56.920
Get over here. We're going together.

369
25:57.000 --> 25:58.720
I have something I need to take care of.

370
25:59.480 --> 26:02.480
Send me the location. I'll follow you there.

371
26:02.560 --> 26:04.880
Raiwin. Raiwin.

372
26:19.360 --> 26:21.360
MAX

373
26:21.440 --> 26:23.720
Hello, Max. The furniture arrived?

374
26:24.400 --> 26:25.520
Ramil.

375
26:26.160 --> 26:28.280
Have the workers start furnishing the rooms.

376
26:28.880 --> 26:30.640
Please answer me.

377
26:31.520 --> 26:35.120
I'll be there soon. I have to go. See you later.

378
26:35.200 --> 26:36.120
Ramil.

379
26:37.200 --> 26:38.080
Answer me, son.

380
26:39.640 --> 26:41.440
So you heard everything.

381
26:42.040 --> 26:44.040
You were going to warn your son?

382
26:44.120 --> 26:45.160
Fine.

383
26:45.240 --> 26:46.480
Call him.

384
26:46.560 --> 26:48.920
Call him and tell him you're on your way

385
26:49.680 --> 26:51.040
to the meeting point.

386
26:51.640 --> 26:52.480
Call him.

387
26:56.480 --> 26:58.600
I said call him.

388
27:11.800 --> 27:13.560
-Ramil. -Mom.

389
27:13.640 --> 27:15.000
I'm on my way.

390
27:15.760 --> 27:16.680
Is something wrong?

391
27:17.520 --> 27:20.080
I'm on my way too. I'll see you there.

392
27:20.680 --> 27:21.720
Okay.

393
27:24.760 --> 27:25.600
Ramil--

394
27:25.680 --> 27:26.600
Hey.

395
27:26.680 --> 27:28.400
Give me that. Do you want to die?

396
27:29.440 --> 27:32.320
Please. Take as much money as you want.

397
27:32.400 --> 27:35.000
Please don't hurt Ramil.

398
27:35.080 --> 27:36.600
I'm begging you.

399
27:37.200 --> 27:40.360
Ramil's life is worth far more than that.

400
27:40.440 --> 27:41.760
I'm not letting him off.

401
27:44.920 --> 27:45.880
You're coming with me.

402
27:47.080 --> 27:48.840
You're going to see your precious son.

403
27:48.920 --> 27:51.080
I'll even let you say goodbye to him

404
27:51.160 --> 27:53.560
and be the first one to hold his body.

405
27:54.080 --> 27:56.240
Move!

406
29:16.160 --> 29:17.800
Why did you follow me?

407
29:18.920 --> 29:20.120
I wanted to drive you home.

408
29:20.920 --> 29:23.640
You wouldn't let me, so I followed you.

409
29:24.760 --> 29:26.560
You've seen that I made it home.

410
29:27.320 --> 29:29.600
Now get out of my house.

411
29:29.680 --> 29:31.640
And never set foot here again.

412
29:34.280 --> 29:35.880
I said get out.

413
29:36.640 --> 29:38.440
I don't want to see your face.

414
29:38.520 --> 29:39.960
Don't be so cold.

415
29:41.280 --> 29:42.600
I came all this way.

416
29:43.280 --> 29:45.160
Let me see your face

417
29:45.840 --> 29:47.520
and your smile one last time.

418
29:48.120 --> 29:50.040
What do you want?

419
29:50.120 --> 29:52.280
If you don't leave,

420
29:52.800 --> 29:54.200
I'm calling the police.

421
29:58.240 --> 30:00.880
I'll call someone to come collect your body myself.

422
30:06.160 --> 30:07.880
Hey! Stop!

423
30:07.960 --> 30:10.320
Help! Help me!

424
30:10.400 --> 30:13.960
Come here!

425
30:29.200 --> 30:30.480
Why did you ask me to come here?

426
30:31.480 --> 30:32.840
Were you ashamed

427
30:33.560 --> 30:35.600
someone would see you taking money from me?

428
30:36.760 --> 30:37.840
Whatever.

429
30:39.040 --> 30:40.400
Take it.

430
30:41.080 --> 30:42.640
Give it to your man.

431
30:43.440 --> 30:44.960
After this, you and I are done.

432
30:45.720 --> 30:46.720
Take it.

433
30:46.800 --> 30:47.840
Take it.

434
30:48.440 --> 30:51.640
Ramil. Run. Run!

435
30:57.440 --> 30:59.960
Ramil, run!

436
31:00.040 --> 31:01.520
I said move!

437
31:01.600 --> 31:04.000
Take the money. Just don't kill my son.

438
31:04.080 --> 31:06.280
No. No.

439
31:06.360 --> 31:07.480
No. No.

440
31:08.080 --> 31:09.440
No.

441
31:09.520 --> 31:12.360
You have the money. Leave Ramil alone.

442
31:12.440 --> 31:15.000
I have to kill him. If I don't,

443
31:15.080 --> 31:16.640
he'll drag me straight to prison.

444
31:16.720 --> 31:19.160
-Get out of the way right now. -No. No.

445
31:19.240 --> 31:20.280
-Get out of my way. -No.

446
31:20.360 --> 31:21.760
Why won't you move?

447
31:25.920 --> 31:28.400
Come here.

448
31:29.440 --> 31:31.360
Stay still.

449
31:33.160 --> 31:34.520
I'm not going to kill you yet.

450
31:35.640 --> 31:37.000
Someone like you

451
31:37.680 --> 31:40.000
is still very useful to me.

452
31:42.160 --> 31:44.640
-Let me go! -Quiet!

453
31:48.440 --> 31:50.120
No one can save you.

454
31:51.600 --> 31:54.880
You tried to destroy my life and my reputation.

455
31:55.880 --> 31:57.000
You have to die.

456
31:59.000 --> 32:01.320
-This is my house. -Let's go see Mommy

457
32:24.320 --> 32:25.960
-Mommy. -Raiwin.

458
32:30.000 --> 32:33.400
Daddy, please don't shoot Mommy.

459
32:35.280 --> 32:36.600
Raiwin.

460
32:37.400 --> 32:40.600
You've already caused enough trouble. Please don't commit another crime.

461
32:43.480 --> 32:45.480
Daddy, please don't shoot Mommy.

462
32:47.080 --> 32:48.960
It's okay if you don't love me.

463
32:51.840 --> 32:54.360
But I only have one mommy.

464
33:22.920 --> 33:24.200
Mommy.

465
33:25.920 --> 33:27.400
It's okay now.

466
33:31.160 --> 33:32.760
Are you hurt?

467
33:33.640 --> 33:35.000
I'm okay.

468
33:35.800 --> 33:38.240
Thank you for coming.

469
33:41.600 --> 33:43.880
There's something I want you to help me with.

470
33:44.480 --> 33:46.200
What do you need?

471
33:46.920 --> 33:49.320
Call the police and have Raiwin arrested.

472
33:50.680 --> 33:52.520
He needs to pay for what he did.

473
33:59.520 --> 34:00.480
Ramil.

474
34:01.800 --> 34:03.200
Where are you? Come out.

475
34:04.920 --> 34:07.920
If you want to see your mother die that badly,

476
34:09.400 --> 34:10.639
then stay hidden.

477
34:11.400 --> 34:13.320
Move.

478
34:14.080 --> 34:16.040
I'll count to three.

479
34:16.120 --> 34:18.560
If you don't come out,

480
34:18.639 --> 34:20.639
you can come collect your mother's body.

481
34:21.360 --> 34:22.360
-Move. -Ramil.

482
34:23.000 --> 34:25.080
Run! Don't worry about me.

483
34:25.159 --> 34:26.400
You.

484
34:26.480 --> 34:28.880
Shut up!

485
34:28.960 --> 34:29.800
One.

486
34:31.080 --> 34:33.840
I know you love me.

487
34:34.880 --> 34:37.560
But you've spent your whole life doing things for me.

488
34:39.560 --> 34:40.880
Two.

489
34:41.600 --> 34:43.719
I'm so proud of you, Ramil.

490
34:45.040 --> 34:48.639
Please let me do something for you for once. Run, sweetheart.

491
34:48.719 --> 34:51.880
Enough. Three. Die!

492
34:51.960 --> 34:52.920
Don't!

493
34:58.200 --> 35:01.040
Ramil, don't do this.

494
35:01.640 --> 35:03.680
You've already done so much for me.

495
35:05.160 --> 35:06.440
Mom.

496
35:10.360 --> 35:12.080
I may not understand

497
35:13.360 --> 35:15.040
why you did everything you did.

498
35:18.720 --> 35:20.040
But I love you.

499
35:24.280 --> 35:26.160
I can't let him hurt you.

500
35:27.480 --> 35:30.560
Your goodbyes are over.

501
35:34.160 --> 35:37.200
Ramil, someone like you

502
35:37.280 --> 35:39.160
has always been nothing but a curse to me.

503
35:39.240 --> 35:41.000
You interfere with everything I do.

504
35:42.760 --> 35:45.240
But this time,

505
35:45.840 --> 35:48.960
I should thank you for bringing me all this money.

506
35:50.400 --> 35:52.040
Once you're dead,

507
35:52.720 --> 35:56.360
all your property and your inheritance go to your mother.

508
35:57.720 --> 36:00.280
And after that,

509
36:01.280 --> 36:03.240
it all goes to me.

510
36:05.240 --> 36:08.280
I'll give you one last chance to speak

511
36:08.880 --> 36:10.760
before I send you to hell.

512
36:17.160 --> 36:18.080
You used to

513
36:20.840 --> 36:23.200
call me a parasite.

514
36:24.400 --> 36:25.520
But today

515
36:27.200 --> 36:28.480
I've proved

516
36:30.480 --> 36:32.560
who the real parasites are.

517
36:34.280 --> 36:37.600
You're corrupt politicians who live off the people's tax money.

518
36:38.920 --> 36:41.240
And you tried to pass your power down to your own son.

519
36:44.520 --> 36:45.640
But believe me.

520
36:47.040 --> 36:49.000
Parasites like you will never prosper.

521
36:49.720 --> 36:51.200
You'll only rot away

522
36:51.280 --> 36:52.960
because you have no roots of your own.

523
36:53.040 --> 36:54.200
Ramil.

524
36:55.040 --> 36:56.480
And the last thing

525
36:58.280 --> 36:59.920
I have to say to you is…

526
37:02.000 --> 37:03.520
go to hell, you bastard.

527
37:03.600 --> 37:05.040
Ramil!

528
37:16.480 --> 37:18.120
Bastard.

529
37:18.200 --> 37:19.520
Bastard.

530
37:28.160 --> 37:30.520
-Saksit! -Ramil, don't.

531
37:31.400 --> 37:32.840
I don't want you to kill anyone.

532
37:42.680 --> 37:45.160
Mom. Are you okay?

533
37:46.200 --> 37:47.360
I'm okay.

534
37:58.120 --> 37:59.720
You killed her, right?

535
38:01.240 --> 38:02.200
I couldn't.

536
38:03.280 --> 38:05.440
I told you to kill her.

537
38:05.520 --> 38:06.840
Get rid of the problem.

538
38:07.440 --> 38:10.240
Hathaya and Papang came in.

539
38:10.320 --> 38:12.920
And Papang begged me not to shoot her.

540
38:14.200 --> 38:15.200
I couldn't do it.

541
38:15.280 --> 38:17.000
Are you out of your mind?

542
38:17.080 --> 38:18.640
If you don't kill her,

543
38:18.720 --> 38:20.280
she'll keep coming after you.

544
38:21.280 --> 38:22.680
Why did you come back here?

545
38:22.760 --> 38:24.920
I tried to do this for you.

546
38:26.600 --> 38:27.840
You still have to help me.

547
38:27.920 --> 38:29.680
You can't abandon me.

548
38:30.440 --> 38:33.000
The police are probably looking for you already.

549
38:33.080 --> 38:34.760
You need to find somewhere to hide.

550
38:38.800 --> 38:40.040
You have to help me.

551
38:40.800 --> 38:42.240
Don't abandon me.

552
38:44.320 --> 38:45.520
Go.

553
38:46.800 --> 38:48.760
Before the police come searching this place.

554
38:49.920 --> 38:50.960
If you don't help me,

555
38:51.920 --> 38:53.120
I'll expose you.

556
38:54.240 --> 38:57.120
I'll tell everyone you ordered me to kill Nuchwara.

557
39:23.880 --> 39:25.320
How is your mother?

558
39:25.400 --> 39:26.560
Oh.

559
39:26.640 --> 39:27.760
They treated her wounds.

560
39:27.840 --> 39:29.440
She should be okay now.

561
39:32.600 --> 39:33.720
Aunt Sanguansri.

562
39:34.320 --> 39:36.240
I hope you feel better soon.

563
39:36.880 --> 39:38.240
Thank you.

564
39:38.320 --> 39:40.560
And thank you for everything you've done for me.

565
39:41.320 --> 39:44.200
Including keeping my secret.

566
39:45.800 --> 39:46.840
Of course.

567
39:48.320 --> 39:49.320
Hey.

568
39:50.200 --> 39:51.600
What secret?

569
39:55.600 --> 39:57.280
Aunt Sanguansri

570
39:58.080 --> 40:01.640
suspected Saksit was involved in your father's death.

571
40:01.720 --> 40:04.640
That's why she decided to stay at Saksit's house.

572
40:08.640 --> 40:10.320
Why didn't you tell me, Mom?

573
40:11.840 --> 40:13.640
Because I know how hot-headed you can be.

574
40:14.200 --> 40:15.960
You might have done something reckless.

575
40:17.200 --> 40:21.200
I kept investigating. Then I overheard him talking to Raiwin.

576
40:21.920 --> 40:25.960
I tried to call and warn you, but everything happened before I could.

577
40:34.680 --> 40:35.720
Mom.

578
40:36.840 --> 40:37.800
I'm sorry.

579
40:39.240 --> 40:40.320
I misunderstood you

580
40:41.080 --> 40:43.080
this whole time.

581
40:46.280 --> 40:47.400
No need to apologize.

582
40:48.360 --> 40:49.800
You're a good son.

583
40:50.400 --> 40:51.800
Everything you did was for me.

584
40:52.920 --> 40:56.160
No matter what happens, I'm proud of you.

585
41:04.320 --> 41:05.640
I love you, Mom.

586
41:08.200 --> 41:09.480
I love you too.

587
41:17.920 --> 41:20.480
Damn it!

588
41:20.560 --> 41:22.760
Everything is ruined!

589
41:23.840 --> 41:25.680
My old cases still aren't settled,

590
41:26.280 --> 41:29.280
and now I have to run from another one?

591
41:31.160 --> 41:32.760
I warned you, Dad.

592
41:33.280 --> 41:34.800
You never listened.

593
41:34.880 --> 41:37.560
This is your fault.

594
41:37.640 --> 41:39.880
If you'd helped me,

595
41:40.440 --> 41:42.080
Ramil would be dead by now.

596
41:43.120 --> 41:43.960
Dad.

597
41:46.520 --> 41:48.000
We won't get away with this.

598
41:50.400 --> 41:51.880
Let's turn ourselves in.

599
41:52.920 --> 41:53.760
Hey.

600
41:54.280 --> 41:56.200
If we confess,

601
41:56.840 --> 41:58.120
the sentence could be reduced.

602
42:00.960 --> 42:02.720
If we hire a good lawyer,

603
42:04.320 --> 42:06.080
we can still fight the case in court.

604
42:08.680 --> 42:09.920
Raiwin!

605
42:13.440 --> 42:16.240
You idiot.

606
42:17.160 --> 42:19.360
You know what I've done.

607
42:19.440 --> 42:21.600
I killed someone.

608
42:22.880 --> 42:25.640
No lawyer is good enough to save me.

609
42:25.720 --> 42:26.760
Understand?

610
42:27.920 --> 42:30.720
If you don't want to turn yourself in, I won't stop you.

611
42:33.480 --> 42:34.920
But I'm turning myself in.

612
42:41.440 --> 42:42.560
If you leave,

613
42:43.240 --> 42:44.400
you die.

614
42:45.160 --> 42:46.080
Raiwin.

615
42:54.640 --> 42:55.480
Dad.

616
42:57.840 --> 42:59.040
That's right.

617
43:00.560 --> 43:02.000
I'm your son.

618
43:03.400 --> 43:04.800
And if you abandon me,

619
43:06.480 --> 43:07.800
you die too.

620
43:10.800 --> 43:12.280
What do you expect me to do?

621
43:13.840 --> 43:14.840
Now,

622
43:15.480 --> 43:16.840
the police are hunting us.

623
43:17.600 --> 43:19.120
There's no way out.

624
43:20.440 --> 43:21.480
No.

625
43:22.960 --> 43:24.440
I'm going to survive somehow.

626
43:26.160 --> 43:27.040
Oh.

627
43:27.800 --> 43:29.120
You know

628
43:29.200 --> 43:32.320
how this country works. Money can buy anything.

629
43:33.040 --> 43:35.720
Can you find more money for me?

630
43:35.800 --> 43:37.720
Then we'll leave Thailand.

631
43:38.480 --> 43:42.560
We'll stay away until the statute of limitations expires. Then we'll come back.

632
43:52.600 --> 43:55.800
You gave him a gun and ordered him to kill Nuchwara?

633
43:56.760 --> 43:58.920
You know how much I hate her.

634
43:59.000 --> 44:00.440
If Raiwin won't kill her,

635
44:00.520 --> 44:02.560
I'll kill her myself.

636
44:02.640 --> 44:05.640
And if…

637
44:05.720 --> 44:08.200
Raiwin gets arrested and exposes you?

638
44:08.280 --> 44:10.480
Then you'll be charged with solicitation of murder.

639
44:10.560 --> 44:12.760
A coward like him

640
44:12.840 --> 44:14.880
has probably fled the country by now.

641
44:15.400 --> 44:16.320
Come on, Mom.

642
44:27.080 --> 44:29.640
Why did you come here? Why didn't you run?

643
44:29.720 --> 44:31.440
I need 50 million.

644
44:31.520 --> 44:33.040
I don't have that kind of money.

645
44:33.640 --> 44:34.560
Hey.

646
44:34.640 --> 44:37.240
My daughter has already given you people more than enough.

647
44:37.320 --> 44:38.720
We have nothing left.

648
44:38.800 --> 44:40.800
Fifty million is cheap.

649
44:42.320 --> 44:44.040
It buys your freedom from a charge

650
44:44.720 --> 44:46.560
of ordering Nuchwara's murder.

651
44:47.200 --> 44:48.320
Don't.

652
44:49.440 --> 44:50.560
I don't have any left.

653
44:50.640 --> 44:52.440
Then use your grandfather's inheritance.

654
44:53.440 --> 44:55.520
There's more than enough there to save your life.

655
44:57.600 --> 44:59.320
If you don't want to go to prison,

656
45:01.080 --> 45:02.400
get me the money.

657
45:06.960 --> 45:09.960
You're useless. You can't do a single thing right.

658
45:10.040 --> 45:11.080
You're just a leech.

659
45:18.360 --> 45:20.080
Chayanee.

660
45:20.160 --> 45:23.400
I warned you again and again not to get involved with those people.

661
45:23.480 --> 45:24.960
They're worse than fleas.

662
45:25.040 --> 45:26.880
Mom, stop complaining

663
45:26.960 --> 45:29.160
and help me figure out where we can get the money.

664
45:30.280 --> 45:32.480
It's hard to take money from the office now.

665
45:32.560 --> 45:35.600
Hathaya is helping oversee the accounts.

666
45:35.680 --> 45:37.320
If she catches us,

667
45:37.400 --> 45:40.680
she'll definitely come after us. That damned woman.

668
45:40.760 --> 45:42.880
Then we need to get rid of her

669
45:43.560 --> 45:45.320
and use Grandpa's inheritance.

670
45:45.400 --> 45:47.400
We don't even know what's in the will.

671
45:47.480 --> 45:49.040
How are we supposed to use it?

672
45:49.800 --> 45:51.840
You're close to Grandpa's lawyer.

673
45:52.360 --> 45:55.560
And don't forget money can buy anything.

674
45:59.080 --> 46:02.000
Then I'll pay the lawyer

675
46:02.760 --> 46:05.160
to tell us what's in Grandpa's will.

676
46:10.640 --> 46:13.280
What does Grandpa's will say?

677
46:14.400 --> 46:17.640
He left that house to Hathaya.

678
46:19.800 --> 46:24.000
It's only one house. I could buy a hundred of them.

679
46:24.080 --> 46:26.640
Grandpa left all the money,

680
46:27.440 --> 46:30.840
property, and real estate to me.

681
46:34.440 --> 46:35.760
No, sweetheart.

682
46:36.440 --> 46:39.800
Grandpa left everything to Hathaya.

683
46:42.520 --> 46:44.400
Then what about us?

684
46:47.320 --> 46:51.120
He only left 10 million each to you and me.

685
46:54.280 --> 46:57.400
Grandpa is playing favorites. He can't do this.

686
46:58.000 --> 47:00.040
He's probably angry

687
47:00.120 --> 47:02.680
about us embezzling money and causing all these problems.

688
47:04.160 --> 47:05.800
If we can't get money for Raiwin,

689
47:06.520 --> 47:09.120
they'll send me to prison.

690
47:09.200 --> 47:10.880
Mom.

691
47:10.960 --> 47:12.480
Call the lawyer back.

692
47:12.560 --> 47:15.600
Pay him to create a fake will.

693
47:15.680 --> 47:18.000
And what if Grandpa recovers

694
47:18.080 --> 47:20.680
and can speak again? Everyone will know

695
47:20.760 --> 47:22.440
the will is fake.

696
47:23.560 --> 47:26.320
Dead people can't talk.

697
47:28.280 --> 47:29.160
Chayanee.

698
47:31.080 --> 47:32.560
You're planning to kill Grandpa?

699
47:34.000 --> 47:35.760
I don't have a choice, Mom.

700
47:37.480 --> 47:38.920
It's the only way

701
47:39.680 --> 47:41.320
I survive.

702
47:41.400 --> 47:43.240
No…

703
47:49.080 --> 47:50.040
Chayanee.

704
47:51.600 --> 47:52.920
Grandpa.

705
47:54.760 --> 47:57.520
I brought you some of the roses Grandma planted.

706
47:58.920 --> 48:00.320
Don't they smell wonderful?

707
48:10.920 --> 48:12.200
Grandpa.

708
48:12.760 --> 48:15.320
Ramil's development is almost finished.

709
48:15.920 --> 48:19.040
I want you to be the guest of honor when we open the new homes.

710
48:21.360 --> 48:24.040
He looks much brighter, Miss Hathaya.

711
48:25.040 --> 48:27.840
It's just a shame he still can't move

712
48:27.920 --> 48:29.600
or speak.

713
48:30.200 --> 48:31.880
It won't be long, Aunt Ann.

714
48:32.880 --> 48:35.000
Grandpa is in good spirits.

715
48:35.080 --> 48:37.120
His body will improve too.

716
48:38.840 --> 48:40.920
Is the herbal medicine ready?

717
48:41.000 --> 48:42.240
Yes.

718
48:42.760 --> 48:44.880
Then I'll pour some for him.

719
48:45.920 --> 48:47.440
Wait for me, Grandpa.

720
48:47.960 --> 48:49.480
Get some rest.

721
49:18.000 --> 49:19.200
Chayanee.

722
49:33.520 --> 49:37.080
I just want to help you sleep well.

723
49:37.160 --> 49:39.240
Please save Mr. Pichai.

724
49:39.320 --> 49:41.840
Grandpa. Grandpa, wake up.

725
49:41.920 --> 49:44.880
NEXT EPISODE

726
49:45.840 --> 49:47.080
-Blood… -Enough, Dad.

727
51:42.640 --> 51:44.880
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
